5. Build Pipeline & Verification
5.1 System Prerequisites
C++ Compiler: GCC 11+, Clang 13+, or MSVC 2022 (C++17 or C++20 standard compliance required)

Framework: Qt 5.15 LTS or Qt 6.4+ (Core, GUI, Widgets modules)

Build System: CMake 3.16+ or qmake

5.2 Compiling with CMake (Recommended for Production / Research)
Bash
# Clone the repository
git clone [https://github.com/chiragrajdadhich05iitp/xbox-xdbf-explorer.git](https://github.com/chiragrajdadhich05iitp/xbox-xdbf-explorer.git)
cd xbox-xdbf-explorer

# Configure modern out-of-source release build
cmake -B build -S . \
    -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \
    -DCMAKE_CXX_STANDARD=17 \
    -DCMAKE_EXPORT_COMPILE_COMMANDS=ON

# Compile target binary utilizing available physical threads
cmake --build build --parallel $(nproc 2>/dev/null || sysctl -n hw.ncpu 2>/dev/null || echo 4)
5.3 Compiling with qmake
Bash
qmake XDBF.pro CONFIG+=release
make -j4
6. Execution & Verification Workflow
Launch Analysis Executable:

Bash
./build/bin/xbox-xdbf-explorer
Load Target Binary:

Provide any uncompressed .gpd profile database (e.g., 4D5307E6.gpd or Title Metadata payloads).

Execution Diagnostics:

Verify magic header validation matches 0x58444246.

Inspect parsed binary leaf nodes via the dynamic structural model view.

Stream raw asset buffers to local storage with verified byte-integrity checks.

